#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:2
msgid "场景1：厨房手套佩戴分析"
msgstr "Scenario 1: Analysis of wearing kitchen gloves"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:3
msgid ""
"本案例演示如何在 ``DaoAI天眼`` 平台上搭建完整的检测工作流，精准识别厨房员工是否规范佩戴防护手套，帮助降低过敏原交叉污染与其他安全隐患。"
msgstr ""
"This case demonstrates how to build a complete detection workflow on the "
"DaoAI Video Analysis Platform platform to accurately identify whether kitchen employees are "
"wearing protective gloves in compliance with regulations, helping to reduce "
"allergen cross-contamination and other safety hazards."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:6
msgid "视频讲解："
msgstr "Video explanation:"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:18
msgid "第一步：数据收集与标注"
msgstr "Step One: Data Collection and Labeling"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:20
msgid "并非所有检测任务都需要训练自定义模型，可根据业务目标选择直接使用预训练模型或自行训练模型。"
msgstr ""
"Not all detection tasks require training a custom model. You can choose to "
"use a pre-trained model directly or train a model yourself according to your"
" business goals."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:22
msgid ""
"我们首先采集真实厨房场景中的视频，重点记录员工在处理食材时的手部动作。随后借助 ``DaoAI World`` "
"标注工具逐帧标记，明确区分“正确佩戴手套”与“未佩戴手套”两类样本。"
msgstr ""
"We first collected videos in real kitchen scenes, focusing on recording the "
"hand movements of employees when handling ingredients.Then, the DaoAI World "
"annotation tool was used to mark the samples frame by frame to clearly "
"distinguish between \"correctly wearing gloves\" and \"not wearing gloves\" "
"samples."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:24
msgid "示例：标注未佩戴手套"
msgstr "Example: Marking that gloves are not worn"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:26
msgid "标注未佩戴手套"
msgstr "Mark not wearing gloves"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:31
msgid "示例：标注正确佩戴手套"
msgstr "Example: Marking the correct wearing of gloves"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:33
msgid "标注正确佩戴手套"
msgstr "Mark the correct wearing of gloves"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:38
msgid "完成标注后，训练数据集并导出 ``dwm`` 格式模型，为后续部署做准备。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the annotation, train the data set and export the model in "
"``dwm`` format to prepare for subsequent deployment."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:41
msgid ""
"我们可以通过天眼平台来直接收集视频数据到标注平台，详情请参阅 `收集数据训练 <http://docs.welinkirt.com/daoai-"
"world-user-manual/latest/train/train_model/index.html>`_ 和 `模型部署 "
"<http://docs.welinkirt.com/daoai-world-user-"
"manual/latest/deploy/deploy_device/index.html>`_ 。"
msgstr ""
"We can directly collect video data to the annotation platform through the "
"Tianyan platform. For details, please refer to `Collecting data training "
"<http://docs.welinkirt.com/daoai-world-user-"
"manual/latest/train/train_model/index.html>`_ and `Model deployment "
"<http://docs.welinkirt.com/daoai-world-user-"
"manual/latest/deploy/deploy_device/index.html>`_ ."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:43
msgid ""
"更完整的标注流程请参阅 `DaoAI World标注指南 <http://docs.welinkirt.com/daoai-world-user-"
"manual/latest/introduce/quick_start/offline_setup.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"For a more complete annotation process, please refer to `DaoAI World "
"Annotation Guide <http://docs.welinkirt.com/daoai-world-user-"
"manual/latest/introduce/quick_start/offline_setup.html>`_."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:47
msgid "第二步：创建工作流"
msgstr "Step 2: Create a workflow"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:49
msgid "拥有标注数据与模型后，即可在 **DaoAI天眼** 平台中构建工作流，串联各模块完成手套佩戴检测。"
msgstr ""
"Once you have annotated data and models, you can build a workflow in the "
"**DaoAI Video Analysis Platform** platform and connect various modules in series to complete"
" glove wearing detection."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:51
msgid "登录 **DaoAI天眼** 平台，进入“工作流”页面。"
msgstr "Log in to the **DaoAI Tianyan** platform and enter the \"Workflow\" page."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:52
msgid "点击右上角 ``新建工作流`` ，建立新的工作流项目。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"New Workflow\" in the upper right corner to create a new workflow "
"project."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:54
msgid "工作流界面"
msgstr "Workflow interface"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:59
msgid "打开工作流编辑器后，点击中央的 ``添加模型`` 按钮导入检测模型。"
msgstr ""
"After opening the workflow editor, click the \"Add Model\" button in the "
"center to import the detection model."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:60
msgid "在弹出的模型选择窗口中，切换到 ``DaoAI World模型`` 选项卡，再次点击该模块进入配置界面。"
msgstr ""
"In the pop-up model selection window, switch to the ``DaoAI World Model`` "
"tab, and click the module again to enter the configuration interface."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:61
msgid "在配置界面中点击 ``未选择模型`` ，选择模型类型。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"No model selected\" in the configuration interface and select the "
"model type."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:62
msgid "依次选择 ``目标检测`` → ``导入训练模型``，上传第一步导出的 ``dwm`` 模型文件。"
msgstr ""
"Select ``Target Detection`` → ``Import Training Model`` and upload the "
"``dwm`` model file exported in the first step."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:63
msgid "选中上传完成的模型，点击右上角 ``保存``。"
msgstr "Select the uploaded model and click Save in the upper right corner."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:65
msgid "上传自定义模型"
msgstr "Upload custom model"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:70
msgid "模型准备就绪后，即可继续配置各个模块。"
msgstr ""
"Once the model is ready, you can proceed with configuring the individual "
"modules."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:73
msgid "第三步：配置工作流"
msgstr "Step 3: Configure workflow"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:75
msgid "熟悉 :ref:`工作流模块` 中的功能后，按照以下步骤逐一连线配置。"
msgstr ""
"After you are familiar with the functions in :ref:`workflow module`, follow "
"the steps below to connect and configure them one by one."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:77
msgid "添加检测过滤模块，用于筛出未佩戴手套的检测结果。"
msgstr ""
"Add a detection filter module to filter out test results without wearing "
"gloves."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:78
msgid "在模型模块下方点击 ``+`` ，选择 ``逻辑处理器``。"
msgstr "Click ``+`` under the model module and select ``Logical Processor``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:79
msgid "在弹窗中选择 ``检测过滤`` 并添加。"
msgstr "Select ``Detection Filtering`` in the pop-up window and add it."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:80
msgid "打开模块，点击 ``配置检测过滤``。"
msgstr "Open the module and click Configure Detection Filtering."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:81
msgid "在配置窗口中勾选 ``对象类别``，输入自定义的“未佩戴手套”类别名称（需与标注一致）。"
msgstr ""
"Check Object Category in the configuration window and enter the custom \"Not"
" Wearing Gloves\" category name (which must be consistent with the label)."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:82
msgid "本案例使用 **unequip** 作为类别，因此输入 **unequip** 后点击 ``保存``。"
msgstr ""
"This case uses **unequip** as the category, so enter **unequip** and click "
"``Save``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:84
msgid "检测过滤配置"
msgstr "Detect filter configuration"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:88
msgid "添加 ``继续执行`` 模块，确保仅在检测到未佩戴手套时才往下流转。"
msgstr ""
"Added a ``continue`` module to ensure that only flow down is detected when "
"no gloves are being worn."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:89
msgid "在模型模块下方再次点击 ``+``，选择 ``逻辑处理器``。"
msgstr ""
"Click the ``+`` again under the model module and select ``Logical "
"Processor``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:90
msgid "在弹窗中选择 ``继续执行`` 并添加。"
msgstr "Select Continue in the pop-up window and add."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:91
msgid "点击模块，选择 ``未配置条件`` 进入条件配置。"
msgstr ""
"Click on the module and select \"Unconfigured conditions\" to enter "
"condition configuration."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:92
msgid "在条件配置中，将检测目标指向上一模块 ``detection_filter_1``。"
msgstr ""
"In the condition configuration, point the detection target to the previous "
"module ``detection_filter_1``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:93
msgid "设置检测阈值为 **大于等于 1**，表示任意一个“未佩戴手套”目标即可继续执行。"
msgstr ""
"Set the detection threshold to **greater than or equal to 1**, which means "
"that any \"not wearing gloves\" target can continue to execute."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:94
msgid "点击 ``保存``。该模块的下一步稍后再行连接。"
msgstr "Click ``Save``.The next step of this module will be connected later."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:96
msgid "继续执行模块添加"
msgstr "Continue to add modules"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:101
msgid "添加 ``边界框可视`` 模块，在画面中直观呈现检测结果。"
msgstr ""
"Add the ``bounding box visual`` module to visually present the detection "
"results on the screen."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:102
msgid "在 ``继续执行`` 模块下方点击 ``+``，选择 ``可视化``。"
msgstr ""
"Click the ``+`` under the ``Continue`` module and select ``Visualize``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:103
msgid "在弹窗中选择 ``边界框可视`` 并添加。"
msgstr "Select \"Bounding box visible\" in the pop-up window and add it."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:104
msgid "返回 ``继续执行`` 模块，将“下一步”指向新添加的 ``边界框可视`` 模块，完成连线。"
msgstr ""
"Return to the ``Continue Execution`` module, point \"Next\" to the newly "
"added ``Bounding Box Visual`` module, and complete the connection."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:105
msgid "打开 ``边界框可视``，在 ``模型预测显示`` 中选择 ``detection_filter_1`` 作为输入。"
msgstr ""
"Turn on ``Bounding box visual`` and select ``detection_filter_1`` as input "
"in ``Model prediction display``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:106
#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:120
#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:134
msgid "点击 ``保存``。"
msgstr "Click ``Save``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:108
msgid "边界框可视模块配置"
msgstr "Bounding box visual module configuration"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:113
msgid "仍可根据需求调整边界框颜色、标签样式等参数，具体请参阅 :ref:`边界框显示`。如需更丰富的呈现，可继续串联其他可视化模块。"
msgstr ""
"You can still adjust the bounding box color, label style and other "
"parameters according to your needs. For details, please refer to "
":ref:`Bounding Box Display`.If you need a richer presentation, you can "
"continue to connect other visualization modules in series."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:115
msgid "添加告警模块，在检测到未佩戴手套时触发事件保存。"
msgstr ""
"Add an alarm module to trigger event saving when no gloves are detected."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:116
msgid "在 ``边界框可视`` 模块下方点击 ``+``，选择 ``数据存储``。"
msgstr ""
"Click the ``+`` under the ``Bounding Box Visible`` module and select ``Data "
"Storage``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:117
msgid "在弹窗中选择 ``事件保存`` 并添加。"
msgstr "Select ``Event Save`` in the pop-up window and add it."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:118
msgid "在配置界面中于 ``事件类型`` 填写告警内容，此处填写 **glove missing**。"
msgstr ""
"In the configuration interface, fill in the alarm content in the ``event "
"type``, fill in **glove missing** here."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:119
msgid "视需求调整输入图像与其他参数，本例仅将“最大视频保存时长”设为 **10 秒**。"
msgstr ""
"Adjust the input image and other parameters as needed. In this example, only"
" set the \"Maximum video storage duration\" to **10 seconds**."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:122
msgid "告警模块配置"
msgstr "Alarm module configuration"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:127
msgid "请保持“原始输入图像”配置为 ``input image``。"
msgstr ""
"Please keep the \"original input image\" configuration as ``input image``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:129
msgid "添加仪表盘可视化模块，将检测结果发布到前端。"
msgstr ""
"Add a dashboard visualization module to publish detection results to the "
"front end."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:130
msgid "在 ``事件保存`` 模块下方点击 ``+``，选择 ``可视化``。"
msgstr ""
"Click ``+`` under the ``Event Saving`` module and select ``Visualization``."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:131
msgid "在弹窗中选择 ``仪表盘可视化`` 并添加。"
msgstr "Select ``Dashboard Visualization`` in the pop-up window and add it."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:132
msgid "点击模块，选择 ``配置仪表盘可视化``。"
msgstr "Click on Modules and select Configure Dashboard Visualization."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:133
msgid "在配置窗口中挑选合适的展示模板，本例选择 ``bounding_box_visualization_1`` 以显示检测框。"
msgstr ""
"Select the appropriate display template in the configuration window. In this"
" example, select ``bounding_box_visualization_1`` to display the detection "
"box."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:136
msgid "仪表盘可视化模块配置"
msgstr "Dashboard visualization module configuration"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:141
msgid "当存在多个可视化模块时，建议将显示配置放在最后一个模块中，以确保所有可视化结果均能呈现在前端。"
msgstr ""
"When there are multiple visualization modules, it is recommended to place "
"the display configuration in the last module to ensure that all "
"visualization results can be presented on the front end."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:143
msgid "至此，工作流配置完毕。请及时点击右上角 ``保存`` ，最好在每个关键步骤后顺手保存，防止配置丢失。"
msgstr ""
"At this point, the workflow configuration is complete.Please click Save in "
"the upper right corner in time. It is best to save after each key step to "
"prevent the configuration from being lost."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:146
msgid "举一反三"
msgstr "learn by analogy"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:148
msgid ""
"上述示例聚焦于核心检测逻辑。实际应用中，工作流还支持更丰富的可视化样式与条件分支，比如在可视化模块中叠加三角形、椭圆等标记，让呈现效果更直观。 "
"建议在此基础上继续探索：可以增设逻辑分支，同时展示“已佩戴”和“未佩戴”两种状态，或针对现场需求微调可视化布局。"
msgstr ""
"The above example focuses on the core detection logic.In practical "
"applications, the workflow also supports richer visual styles and "
"conditional branches, such as superimposing triangles, ellipses and other "
"markers in the visualization module to make the presentation effect more "
"intuitive.It is recommended to continue to explore on this basis: you can "
"add logical branches to display the two states of \"worn\" and \"not worn\" "
"at the same time, or fine-tune the visual layout according to on-site needs."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:151
msgid "下方提供一套完整工作流供参考，欢迎对照学习并进一步优化。"
msgstr ""
"A complete set of workflows is provided below for reference. Welcome to "
"study and further optimize."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:153
msgid "完整工作流示例"
msgstr "Complete workflow example"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:159
msgid "第四步：配置摄像头"
msgstr "Step 4: Configure the camera"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:160
msgid "完成工作流配置并 **保存** 后，就可以设置摄像头，让厨房画面与实时检测结果同步呈现。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the workflow configuration and **saving**, you can set up "
"the camera so that the kitchen images and real-time detection results are "
"presented simultaneously."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:162
msgid "首先进入 **摄像头输入** 页面，点击 ``新增摄像头`` 新建一个摄像头条目。"
msgstr ""
"First enter the **Camera Input** page and click ``Add Camera`` to create a "
"new camera entry."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:164
msgid "摄像头配置界面"
msgstr "Camera configuration interface"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:169
msgid "在弹窗中依次填写摄像头名称与 RTSP 视频流地址，并点击 ``预览摄像头`` 核对画面是否正常；视频解码设备保持默认的 cpu 解码即可。"
msgstr ""
"Fill in the camera name and RTSP video stream address in the pop-up window, "
"and click \"Preview Camera\" to check whether the picture is normal; the "
"video decoding device can keep the default CPU decoding."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:171
msgid ""
"预览无误后点击 ``下一步``，在下拉框中选择我们稍早创建的工作流。右侧菜单可调节 fps "
"参数：上方控制检测速度，下方控制检测频率。通常将检测频率设置为 1 fps（每秒检测 1 帧）即可满足大多数场景。"
msgstr ""
"After the preview is correct, click Next and select the workflow we created "
"earlier in the drop-down box.The right menu can adjust the fps parameters: "
"the upper part controls the detection speed, and the lower part controls the"
" detection frequency.Typically setting the detection frequency to 1 fps "
"(detecting 1 frame per second) is sufficient for most scenarios."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:173
msgid "确认各项配置无误后，点击 ``保存`` 完成设置。"
msgstr ""
"After confirming that all configurations are correct, click Save to complete"
" the settings."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:175
msgid "摄像头工作流配置"
msgstr "Camera workflow configuration"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:180
msgid "返回 **摄像头输入** 页面，点击刚创建摄像头右侧的 ``预览`` 按钮，即可看到实时检测画面的截图。"
msgstr ""
"Return to the **Camera Input** page and click the ``Preview`` button on the "
"right side of the newly created camera to see a screenshot of the real-time "
"detection screen."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:182
msgid "点击左侧三角形图标可以展开摄像头详情，在 AI 检测列表中点击开启图标即可运行该摄像头工作流。"
msgstr ""
"Click the triangle icon on the left to expand the camera details, and click "
"the open icon in the AI ​​detection list to run the camera workflow."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:184
msgid "摄像头预览界面"
msgstr "Camera preview interface"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:189
msgid "当检测状态显示为“运行”且吞吐量下方的 fps 数值开始上升时，就意味着工作流已成功启动，摄像头配置也随之完成。"
msgstr ""
"When the detection status shows \"Running\" and the fps number under "
"Throughput starts to increase, the workflow has been successfully started "
"and the camera configuration is complete."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:192
msgid "第五步：查看实时监控与警报"
msgstr "Step 5: View real-time monitoring and alerts"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:194
msgid "配置完摄像头后，即可前往 **实时警报** 页面查看实时监控画面。"
msgstr ""
"After configuring the camera, you can go to the **Real-time Alert** page to "
"view the real-time monitoring screen."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:196
msgid "在实时警报页面中，我们可以点击下方的摄像头图标并选择刚配置的摄像头，即可看到实时画面与检测结果。"
msgstr ""
"In the real-time alarm page, we can click the camera icon below and select "
"the newly configured camera to see the real-time picture and detection "
"results."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:198
msgid "实时警报界面"
msgstr "Real-time alert interface"

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:203
msgid ""
"在这个界面中，左边部分为统计数据，会将各个事件类型的告警数量进行汇总；右边部分为实时警报消息列表，点击每条消息即可查看对应的检测报告以及解决与否的选项。"
msgstr ""
"In this interface, the left part is statistical data, which summarizes the "
"number of alarms for each event type; the right part is a list of real-time "
"alarm messages. Click on each message to view the corresponding detection "
"report and options for resolution."

#: ../../source/case_study/kitchen_allergy.rst:205
msgid ""
"如果是用的是虚拟视频流作为数据源，在码率 (bitrate) 较高时，可能会导致实时画面加载较慢，建议适当调低码率以提升加载速度。(例如将码率调至 "
"3000kbps 以下)"
msgstr ""
"If you use a virtual video stream as the data source, when the bitrate is "
"high, the real-time image may be loaded slowly. It is recommended to lower "
"the bitrate appropriately to improve the loading speed.(For example, adjust "
"the code rate to below 3000kbps)"

